@* Sits where rauvang.com puts its installment promo banner (homepage and
   every category page). Ours states the store's own general policies, the
   same ones the variant page lists. No promotion system exists yet, so no
   discount figures are invented here. The numbers count up on scroll. *@
<section class="promo-banner">
    <div class="promo-banner-copy">
        <div class="promo-banner-kicker">Buy with confidence</div>
        <h2>Genuine Apple hardware, backed by the store</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="promo-banner-stats">
        <div class="promo-stat">
            <div class="num" data-count-to="12">12</div>
            <div class="label">month warranty, 1-for-1 on defects</div>
        </div>
        <div class="promo-stat">
            <div class="num" data-count-to="30">30</div>
            <div class="label">day return window</div>
        </div>
        <div class="promo-stat">
            <div class="num" data-count-to="3">3</div>
            <div class="label">ways to pay: COD, VNPay, MoMo</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
